				<wikidot:authorName>DrMorris</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2231487</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p><strong>Sample 887-6776:</strong> 2353 pages, English. The phrase &quot;Does the black moon howl?&quot; repeated over 27 thousand times.</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>Do you hear the Black Moon howling, 13? You will, soon. (<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/djkaktus-s-proposal">djkaktus's Proposal</a>, SCP-001)</p> </blockquote> <p>Is this in any way related, or is it just a coincidence?</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
