					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I put that in and it's exactly as ObserverSeptember said-it's clearly Greek but with features not matching any attested form of the language. (It's from a parallel universe, after all.) Part of the implication is that the Foundation can't match it at all to a specific dialect of Greek in our world, whether surviving or extinct.</p> 
				 	]]>
