					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-207431#post-1531248</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-207431/scp-887-log#post-1531248</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 08 Aug 2012 14:24:22 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Drewbear</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>301632</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Sample 887-3391 actually happened to me as a kid.</p> <p>There was a fairly large undeveloped plot near where I lived, which included a steep hill with several kid-made bike trails down it. One day, I was riding down the least steep one and got hit across the forehead by a fishing line some asshole had stretched across the path. It was tied so well to the trees beside the path that I was literally yanked off my bike and had an imprint across my forehead for over a month. If I had been a little taller, it would've gone across my eyes.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
